From 6773c83764672ccd653ddbef31fe299f7a9059ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felix Krueckel <hi@felkru.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 13:45:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 07/49] embedded: Anthropic API key row in Warp Agent settings

The key is handed straight to the host app (window.warpPanelStoreApiKey) and never kept in
Warp. Deep link: warp://settings?widget=host_api_key. The '#' trigger toggle is enabled whenever
AI command search is available.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 app/src/platform/wasm.rs                 |   9 ++
 app/src/settings_view/mod.rs             |   4 +
 app/src/settings_view/warp_agent_page.rs | 125 ++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 136 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/src/platform/wasm.rs b/app/src/platform/wasm.rs
